                <pb facs="1254" n="1096" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1096"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Thompson
                        to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mexico
                            City</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-09-27"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">September 27,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your message 21 instant with quotation. The Mexican authorities have issued no
                    such instructions as this quotation indicates. Their patrol vessels have
                    instructions to take into custody within the 3–mile limit only such vessels as
                    are fishing or known to have been fishing within this limit.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thompson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
